1. How to compile multi_process.c in terminal:
    gcc multi_process.c 
    ./a.out 90 81 78 95 79 72 85

   How to compile multi_thread.java in terminal:
    javac multi_thread.java 
    java multi_thread 90 81 78 95 79 72 85

2. Five screenshots have been included in the zip file. Two images are outputs of the C file and three are images of java outputs. 

